	"\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> A planet of heavy volcanic activity and little native flora, Point Barrow is a desolate fringe-world better suited to forward staging than colonization. Residents tend to remain off the ground as much as possible, for fear of local wildlife.\n<f1>Map created for <f2>hvMechWarrior<f1> by <f2>hvPalantirion\n<f1>You can locate <f0>House Vagoroth<f1> at <f2>www.geocities.com/TimesSquare/Fortress/5514";


